; xfail: error: member y of EmitHelpers: the concept is not visible in this file
;
; args: -S --no-prelude
;
; Regression (2026-09-24): a field read two hops down a chain whose middle type
; the module does not `use` — `c.helpers.y` with the record holding `helpers`
; used and the helpers' own concept not. The planner recorded an advisory
; miss, and the EMITTER aborted: rc 16, `Emitter: member not found:
; EmitHelpers.y`, no file and no line (tscaly lessons §3.5jf). It is reported
; at the access now, with the `use` that fixes it. A LIBRARY root, like
; xfail_when_hidden_union: a library's modules are where the gate bites.
define xfail_hidden_member_hop
{
    module helpers
    module ctx
    module user
}
